1
00:00:00,360 --> 00:00:01,620
(Howard:)See?

2
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:03,740
(Howard:)With the grain.

3
00:00:03,740 --> 00:00:06,360
(Penny:)Wow, that is better.

4
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:09,050
(Howard:)And someday, when you
have varicose veins,

5
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:10,970
(Howard:)I'll show you how to massage them.

6
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:17,890
(Raj:)Oh, God, never again.

7
00:00:17,890 --> 00:00:20,880
I assume by "never again,
" you mean never again will you drink

8
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:23,260
(Leonard:)all of Penny's beer,
then run down to the gas station

9
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:25,480
(Leonard:)for a couple of 40s,
a box of Slim Jims

10
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:29,400
and the latest issue of
Bombay Badonkadonks.

11
00:00:30,270 --> 00:00:32,590
(Raj:)I was homesick.

12
00:00:32,590 --> 00:00:34,690
(Howard:)The highlight of the evening
was when you showed us

13
00:00:34,690 --> 00:00:36,780
(Howard:)your Bollywood break
dancing skills.

14
00:00:36,780 --> 00:00:38,990
(humming Indian music)

15
00:00:44,420 --> 00:00:46,540
(Raj:)That's very offensive.

16
00:00:46,540 --> 00:00:48,620
(Howard:)Yeah, we all thought so.

17
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:50,920
LEONARD: Oh, no.

18
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:51,920
(Leonard:)What?

19
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:54,290
It's John and Yoko.

20
00:00:54,290 --> 00:00:57,050
(Howard:)More like Yoko and Yoko.

